(6169023, 910718, 60173, '<td valign="top">As much as I love the idea of this, I think it could have been a little better with a <u>slightly</u> faster shutter speed. Without the challenge topic one wouldn''t know that there was a person on the chair. I would have liked to see a bit more of the silhouette.</td>', 'As much as I love the idea of this, I think it could have been a little better with a slightly faster shutter speed. Without the challenge topic one wouldn''t know that there was a person on the chair. I would have liked to see a bit more of the silhouette.', '2010-09-22 05:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
