(6169088, 910374, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like the energy you tried to put into this image, but the background is too distracting for the energy to be prominent in the photo.  Try starting with a cleaner background or use a very narrow depth of field if no clean background is available.</td>', 'I like the energy you tried to put into this image, but the background is too distracting for the energy to be prominent in the photo.  Try starting with a cleaner background or use a very narrow depth of field if no clean background is available.', '2010-09-22 08:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
