(6169099, 910774, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light on her is very beautiful and I love the texture of the floor, but I''m distracted by the things in the background.</td>', 'The light on her is very beautiful and I love the texture of the floor, but I''m distracted by the things in the background.', '2010-09-22 08:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
