(6169103, 910402, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you had pulled up the whites a bit more to add a bit more contrast.  As it is now, the brightest parts of the image are still very grey.  Still, nice photo and composition.</td>', 'I wish you had pulled up the whites a bit more to add a bit more contrast.  As it is now, the brightest parts of the image are still very grey.  Still, nice photo and composition.', '2010-09-22 08:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
