(6169111, 910477, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the spotlight under/behind the chair.  I think the side light (photo''s right, subject''s left) lights too much.  If you put it a bit more behind him, it would have given more of an edge light, which would create a slightly darker image that would better fit the title.  I think I might have moved the main light more to his side as well, for the same reason.  I think there is too much light on him for him to still be considered vulnerable.</td>', 'I love the spotlight under/behind the chair.  I think the side light (photo''s right, subject''s left) lights too much.  If you put it a bit more behind him, it would have given more of an edge light, which would create a slightly darker image that would better fit the title.  I think I might have moved the main light more to his side as well, for the same reason.  I think there is too much light on him for him to still be considered vulnerable.', '2010-09-22 08:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169113, 910036, 33361, '<td valign="top">Poifect!</td>', 'Poifect!', '2010-09-22 08:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169114, 910664, 33361, '<td valign="top">lol love it! Looks like a confessional!</td>', 'lol love it! Looks like a confessional!', '2010-09-22 08:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169115, 910211, 47470, '<td valign="top">I find the bag very distracting because it is so bright, especially compared to her face.  It looks like her hands are brighter than her face too, which I''d guess to be a result of how you converted to black and white.  That said, I think the tones are otherwise lovely and I think her expression is very fitting.</td>', 'I find the bag very distracting because it is so bright, especially compared to her face.  It looks like her hands are brighter than her face too, which I''d guess to be a result of how you converted to black and white.  That said, I think the tones are otherwise lovely and I think her expression is very fitting.', '2010-09-22 08:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169116, 910384, 33361, '<td valign="top">LOVE this - my only teeny tiny complaint is her arm being in the shade.</td>', 'LOVE this - my only teeny tiny complaint is her arm being in the shade.', '2010-09-22 08:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169118, 910755, 33361, '<td valign="top">Great... now I''m going to have nightmares!!</td>', 'Great... now I''m going to have nightmares!!', '2010-09-22 08:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169119, 910411, 47470, '<td valign="top">The chair and the pose fit very well with the light.  The shadows on the wall behind the subject also add some very nice atmosphere.  The only thing I would change would be to move the camera (or the subject and chair!) to eliminate the small piece of window  on the side, which makes that part of the image a little too cluttered for my taste.</td>', 'The chair and the pose fit very well with the light.  The shadows on the wall behind the subject also add some very nice atmosphere.  The only thing I would change would be to move the camera (or the subject and chair!) to eliminate the small piece of window  on the side, which makes that part of the image a little too cluttered for my taste.', '2010-09-22 08:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169122, 910236, 47470, '<td valign="top">The expression on the face of the subject makes me think she was very uncomfortable in front of the camera.  Since the expression of the subject can make or break the atmosphere of the image, I would have chosen a pose where the model''s face was more relaxed or calm.  I''m also not a fan of the processing, but I do like the clean textures of the floor and the background.</td>', 'The expression on the face of the subject makes me think she was very uncomfortable in front of the camera.  Since the expression of the subject can make or break the atmosphere of the image, I would have chosen a pose where the model''s face was more relaxed or calm.  I''m also not a fan of the processing, but I do like the clean textures of the floor and the background.', '2010-09-22 08:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169124, 910714, 47470, '<td valign="top">While the angle of the camera is very unusual, it makes the subject look very short and small, especially with so much background.  As such, I don''t think I like the angle of this.  Did you HDR the floor?  It looks kinda funny and I think it takes away from the model.</td>', 'While the angle of the camera is very unusual, it makes the subject look very short and small, especially with so much background.  As such, I don''t think I like the angle of this.  Did you HDR the floor?  It looks kinda funny and I think it takes away from the model.', '2010-09-22 08:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169125, 910392, 47470, '<td valign="top">How lovely!  The face matches the outfit matches the pose matches the chair matches the background!  Everything fits together so perfectly!  Well done!  Great colors too.  I''m sure he''ll love this image.</td>', 'How lovely!  The face matches the outfit matches the pose matches the chair matches the background!  Everything fits together so perfectly!  Well done!  Great colors too.  I''m sure he''ll love this image.', '2010-09-22 08:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169127, 910370, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish her hair wasn''t covering half of her face.  I think if you had used a shallow dept of field and left this in color (though BnW might look nice too), this would appeal to people more.</td>', 'I wish her hair wasn''t covering half of her face.  I think if you had used a shallow dept of field and left this in color (though BnW might look nice too), this would appeal to people more.', '2010-09-22 08:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169128, 910713, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the light was the tiniest bit softer (maybe wait until a cloud passes in front of the sun?).  I love that the chair is much more colorful than the rest of the image, though I might have taken it a step further and desaturated everything but the chair and the subject.  Putting the model in a solid color shirt would make this a bit more dreamy by taking away anything that might date the image.</td>', 'I wish the light was the tiniest bit softer (maybe wait until a cloud passes in front of the sun?).  I love that the chair is much more colorful than the rest of the image, though I might have taken it a step further and desaturated everything but the chair and the subject.  Putting the model in a solid color shirt would make this a bit more dreamy by taking away anything that might date the image.', '2010-09-22 08:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169129, 910666, 47470, '<td valign="top">I can see where you were going with this, but I think it would have worked better with a black chair and a white card bouncing a bit more light on his face.  The eye is usually attracted to the brightest part of the image, which, unfortunately in this image, is not the person.</td>', 'I can see where you were going with this, but I think it would have worked better with a black chair and a white card bouncing a bit more light on his face.  The eye is usually attracted to the brightest part of the image, which, unfortunately in this image, is not the person.', '2010-09-22 08:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169130, 910757, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  The light is nice, but you could make it better by using a light behind the subject to his right (image left) to separate him from the background.  You could also use curves to brighten the upper range of the image to that your whites (like the paper) are actually white instead of grey.</td>', 'I like the idea.  The light is nice, but you could make it better by using a light behind the subject to his right (image left) to separate him from the background.  You could also use curves to brighten the upper range of the image to that your whites (like the paper) are actually white instead of grey.', '2010-09-22 08:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169131, 910664, 47470, '<td valign="top">Love it.  I half wish there was something on one side of the chair to break up the symmetry a bit.  Still, this is a fun image.</td>', 'Love it.  I half wish there was something on one side of the chair to break up the symmetry a bit.  Still, this is a fun image.', '2010-09-22 08:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169134, 910676, 47470, '<td valign="top">The backlight is perfect.  I love the shadow it makes on the floor!  The old window frame on one side helps break up the symmetry a bit, which helps the image a lot.  The only thing I would change is the main light in front of her.  I would move it a lot more to camera left, almost directly to the side of the model to create moody light and some shadows on her face.  The model also looks a little uncomfortable.  Were there any other outtakes with a stronger or more relaxed expression?</td>', 'The backlight is perfect.  I love the shadow it makes on the floor!  The old window frame on one side helps break up the symmetry a bit, which helps the image a lot.  The only thing I would change is the main light in front of her.  I would move it a lot more to camera left, almost directly to the side of the model to create moody light and some shadows on her face.  The model also looks a little uncomfortable.  Were there any other outtakes with a stronger or more relaxed expression?', '2010-09-22 08:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169135, 910758, 47470, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, "legs spread towards the camera" is not the most attractive pose.  The highlight on his clothes are also too blown for my taste.</td>', 'Unfortunately, "legs spread towards the camera" is not the most attractive pose.  The highlight on his clothes are also too blown for my taste.', '2010-09-22 08:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169139, 910471, 47470, '<td valign="top">The graffiti works very well with his outfit, but I would have preferred a shallow depth of field to blur out the rest of the background.</td>', 'The graffiti works very well with his outfit, but I would have preferred a shallow depth of field to blur out the rest of the background.', '2010-09-22 08:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169141, 910715, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the dream-like quality and the patch of blue sky that matches her dress, but I wish the light was a little softer (wait for a cloud to pass in front of the sun?) and at a bit of an angle to her to create a little bit of shadow, which adds dimension to the image.</td>', 'I love the dream-like quality and the patch of blue sky that matches her dress, but I wish the light was a little softer (wait for a cloud to pass in front of the sun?) and at a bit of an angle to her to create a little bit of shadow, which adds dimension to the image.', '2010-09-22 08:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169142, 910703, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks more candid than a portrait, which makes the subject look surprised or uncomfortable.</td>', 'This looks more candid than a portrait, which makes the subject look surprised or uncomfortable.', '2010-09-22 08:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169147, 910694, 47470, '<td valign="top">It looks like you tried to saturate the colors a bit more while darkening the highlights on her head, which has made the top of her head look strange and noticeably cyan.  Her expression is lovely, but I wish you had used a shallow depth of field to blur out some of the texture of the background.</td>', 'It looks like you tried to saturate the colors a bit more while darkening the highlights on her head, which has made the top of her head look strange and noticeably cyan.  Her expression is lovely, but I wish you had used a shallow depth of field to blur out some of the texture of the background.', '2010-09-22 08:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169150, 910036, 47470, '<td valign="top">Cool image with nice light.  Separating black shoes and a black jacket from the background is pretty difficult, but you did it perfectly.</td>', 'Cool image with nice light.  Separating black shoes and a black jacket from the background is pretty difficult, but you did it perfectly.', '2010-09-22 09:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169151, 909944, 47470, '<td valign="top">This image is a little underexposed, making the model''s hair blend into her shirt.  A properly exposed image would have made here eyes stand out a bit more too.</td>', 'This image is a little underexposed, making the model''s hair blend into her shirt.  A properly exposed image would have made here eyes stand out a bit more too.', '2010-09-22 09:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169154, 910772, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the word "permission" wasn''t divided in two.</td>', 'I wish the word "permission" wasn''t divided in two.', '2010-09-22 09:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169169, 910392, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really endearing. Love his smile.</td>', 'Really endearing. Love his smile.', '2010-09-22 09:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169172, 910664, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  This series of yours is really turning out great.  The mask - haha!  Fabulous addition.</td>', 'ROFL  This series of yours is really turning out great.  The mask - haha!  Fabulous addition.', '2010-09-22 09:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169174, 910405, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE!!!!!  The balloon is perfect.  Man, I hope that guy didn''t fall down. Only problem is, to me, this isn''t about his face at all, which is what a true portrait is about.  Hmmmmm  Now I''m torn.</td>', 'LOVE!!!!!  The balloon is perfect.  Man, I hope that guy didn''t fall down. Only problem is, to me, this isn''t about his face at all, which is what a true portrait is about.  Hmmmmm  Now I''m torn.', '2010-09-22 09:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169175, 910354, 15711, '<td valign="top">Since a portrait is all about the face and she isn''t up so close, I wish she were looking at the camera, and not in profile, although it is a terrific image. Just my opinion (which isn''t worth much these days LOL)</td>', 'Since a portrait is all about the face and she isn''t up so close, I wish she were looking at the camera, and not in profile, although it is a terrific image. Just my opinion (which isn''t worth much these days LOL)', '2010-09-22 09:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169176, 910738, 15711, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is fabulous.  I can still see the face, which is what a portrait truly is about.  The walking stick and use of shadow - SUPERB!!  The most artfully presented image so far. 10 10 10</td>', 'Now THAT is fabulous.  I can still see the face, which is what a portrait truly is about.  The walking stick and use of shadow - SUPERB!!  The most artfully presented image so far. 10 10 10', '2010-09-22 09:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169177, 909974, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding.  You just kill me with your ability to capture your kids in every light.  Where on earth did you get that desk?  LOVE LOVE!!!</td>', 'This is outstanding.  You just kill me with your ability to capture your kids in every light.  Where on earth did you get that desk?  LOVE LOVE!!!', '2010-09-22 09:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169178, 910471, 15711, '<td valign="top">With so much going on around him with the chair, the old building and the fallen lumber on the ground,with so many colors,  I think a high contrast black and white would have suited it better. Our eye is jumping around the page trying to find a place to rest.  I hope that makes sense.  Just my opinion anyway, which doesn''t account for much these days. LOL Good luck!! 6</td>', 'With so much going on around him with the chair, the old building and the fallen lumber on the ground,with so many colors,  I think a high contrast black and white would have suited it better. Our eye is jumping around the page trying to find a place to rest.  I hope that makes sense.  Just my opinion anyway, which doesn''t account for much these days. LOL Good luck!! 6', '2010-09-22 09:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169179, 910036, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific.  I love the lighting and the simple black and white.  His leg is perfectly parallel with the bottom of the page, and the chair cushion''s lines.  Nicely done.  I think the untied bow really adds, as it is a shape against the white shirt, that we aren''t expecting in the shot. 8</td>', 'Terrific.  I love the lighting and the simple black and white.  His leg is perfectly parallel with the bottom of the page, and the chair cushion''s lines.  Nicely done.  I think the untied bow really adds, as it is a shape against the white shirt, that we aren''t expecting in the shot. 8', '2010-09-22 09:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169180, 910676, 15711, '<td valign="top">What makes this really work for me is the out of kilter old window to her right.  It offsets it and makes it less typical, since she''s centered perfectly in the shot.  Love the shadow on the floor. Looks almost like a top hat.  Nice. 8</td>', 'What makes this really work for me is the out of kilter old window to her right.  It offsets it and makes it less typical, since she''s centered perfectly in the shot.  Love the shadow on the floor. Looks almost like a top hat.  Nice. 8', '2010-09-22 09:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169182, 910211, 15711, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the fact that she''s in a 60''s style chair, which was probably when she was in her hayday.  The purse is a nice touch too although it does create a bit of a light reflection. It''s not enough to dissuade me from really loving it.  We don''t often see older people in portraits, so that makes me like it this much more.  She has such a sense of resolve.  Congrats to you (and her).  I like it. 8</td>', 'I LOVE the fact that she''s in a 60''s style chair, which was probably when she was in her hayday.  The purse is a nice touch too although it does create a bit of a light reflection. It''s not enough to dissuade me from really loving it.  We don''t often see older people in portraits, so that makes me like it this much more.  She has such a sense of resolve.  Congrats to you (and her).  I like it. 8', '2010-09-22 09:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169183, 910718, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the artful approach but this, to me, isn''t a portrait, which should be all about the face.</td>', 'Love the artful approach but this, to me, isn''t a portrait, which should be all about the face.', '2010-09-22 09:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169184, 910355, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is much more about the sky than the guy but since we can''t see it really big, that''s not your fault.</td>', 'This is much more about the sky than the guy but since we can''t see it really big, that''s not your fault.', '2010-09-22 09:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169188, 910762, 15711, '<td valign="top">Heh, I get that look from my 15 year old all the time. LOL  Not a huge fan of the wide gold frame. I like the perspective.</td>', 'Heh, I get that look from my 15 year old all the time. LOL  Not a huge fan of the wide gold frame. I like the perspective.', '2010-09-22 09:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169202, 910770, 112218, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2010-09-22 10:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169204, 910758, 112218, '<td valign="top">Interesting colour and take on the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting colour and take on the challenge.', '2010-09-22 10:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
