(6169312, 910043, 48502, '<td valign="top">i like the pose, i think a solid black background would work better than the one showing the shadow though</td>', 'i like the pose, i think a solid black background would work better than the one showing the shadow though', '2010-09-22 11:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
