(6169351, 910716, 48502, '<td valign="top">great model great makeup I think a slightly different crop would make it even stronger more rule of third</td>', 'great model great makeup I think a slightly different crop would make it even stronger more rule of third', '2010-09-22 12:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
