(6169357, 910767, 48502, '<td valign="top">i like the way you followed the guidelines, the picture definitely tells something about the subject of the photo, the light and composition are nice but could be more dramatic</td>', 'i like the way you followed the guidelines, the picture definitely tells something about the subject of the photo, the light and composition are nice but could be more dramatic', '2010-09-22 12:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169360, 910376, 117831, '<td valign="top">While this is a cool image I dont consider it a portrait and also there is a weird black thing in the corner. 4</td>', 'While this is a cool image I dont consider it a portrait and also there is a weird black thing in the corner. 4', '2010-09-22 12:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169381, 910698, 97760, '<td valign="top">This is such a good picture but too bad about the floor and the board running across.  It takes away by telling you that the picture is taken at home in the hallway when the setting is to be supernatural. 8</td>', 'This is such a good picture but too bad about the floor and the board running across.  It takes away by telling you that the picture is taken at home in the hallway when the setting is to be supernatural. 8', '2010-09-22 12:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169385, 910770, 22689, '<td valign="top">There''s something magnetic in this photo, I really like it even if I''d prefer a B&amp;W version (no pink shirt). The first thought when I saw this photo was : it''s a woman of tranquil force. A great portrait imo !</td>', 'There''s something magnetic in this photo, I really like it even if I''d prefer a B&W version (no pink shirt). The first thought when I saw this photo was : it''s a woman of tranquil force. A great portrait imo !', '2010-09-22 12:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169387, 910372, 96751, '<td valign="top">I was going to enter something like this as well but never got around to shooting :-)  Lovely pov and great tones and dof.  Perhaps a tad dark overall - I''d have liked just a tiny bit more on her face (which appears darker than the white shirt to the right).</td>', 'I was going to enter something like this as well but never got around to shooting :-)  Lovely pov and great tones and dof.  Perhaps a tad dark overall - I''d have liked just a tiny bit more on her face (which appears darker than the white shirt to the right).', '2010-09-22 12:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169389, 910616, 96751, '<td valign="top">This would also have worked in high key.   Gorgeous, very dynamic, with good detail.</td>', 'This would also have worked in high key.   Gorgeous, very dynamic, with good detail.', '2010-09-22 12:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169391, 910664, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is SO close to being great.  Very whimsical idea, terrific location/chair/floor/wall.  I just wish a bit more attention had been paid to the wardrobe.  It seems so pedestrian for such a playful idea, and doesn''t contribute to the overall absurdist feeling.  At least they''re nicely pressed :-)</td>', 'Oh, this is SO close to being great.  Very whimsical idea, terrific location/chair/floor/wall.  I just wish a bit more attention had been paid to the wardrobe.  It seems so pedestrian for such a playful idea, and doesn''t contribute to the overall absurdist feeling.  At least they''re nicely pressed :-)', '2010-09-22 12:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169394, 910619, 97760, '<td valign="top">Very Very good! That 3 dimensional effect is outstanding! Best one - 10</td>', 'Very Very good! That 3 dimensional effect is outstanding! Best one - 10', '2010-09-22 12:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169397, 910698, 96751, '<td valign="top">I could tell just from the thumbnail that this is going on the fp.  Probably ribbon.  Strong composition and obviously, wonderful lighting, although for me, it drops off too much at the very bottom and far right and we lose a lot of detail there.  Everything else is dynamite.</td>', 'I could tell just from the thumbnail that this is going on the fp.  Probably ribbon.  Strong composition and obviously, wonderful lighting, although for me, it drops off too much at the very bottom and far right and we lose a lot of detail there.  Everything else is dynamite.', '2010-09-22 13:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169399, 910762, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh, you really captured the teenage surliness!  Love the disembodiment of this little scene - anger and resentment in the void.</td>', 'Oh, you really captured the teenage surliness!  Love the disembodiment of this little scene - anger and resentment in the void.', '2010-09-22 13:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169402, 910354, 96751, '<td valign="top">Surreal and wonderful.  Love the concrete corner location and the lighting is sensational.  But the focus seems just a bit off.  It seems to be sharper just behind her - the back of the chair and her hair is a bit fuzzy.  I see this in b/w.</td>', 'Surreal and wonderful.  Love the concrete corner location and the lighting is sensational.  But the focus seems just a bit off.  It seems to be sharper just behind her - the back of the chair and her hair is a bit fuzzy.  I see this in b/w.', '2010-09-22 13:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169409, 910745, 96751, '<td valign="top">Everything about this image is awkward, and I can''t tell if it is intentional, but it doesn''t really work for me as there doesn''t appear to be a reason for the awkwardness other than to be awkward (sheesh!  how many times can a person use awkward in one sentence!!!!!)<br/> <br/>Also, a little more attention to the details of the setting would be nice (here we are drawn to the imperfections on the back wall - lines, scratches, holes), and the band across the bottom bisects the image rather than contributes to it.<br/> <br/>But clearly, something is working since it compelled me to write a whole essay!</td>', 'Everything about this image is awkward, and I can''t tell if it is intentional, but it doesn''t really work for me as there doesn''t appear to be a reason for the awkwardness other than to be awkward (sheesh!  how many times can a person use awkward in one sentence!!!!!) Also, a little more attention to the details of the setting would be nice (here we are drawn to the imperfections on the back wall - lines, scratches, holes), and the band across the bottom bisects the image rather than contributes to it. But clearly, something is working since it compelled me to write a whole essay!', '2010-09-22 13:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169410, 910402, 96751, '<td valign="top">Heartbreaking and oddly charming, with just a bit too much contrast to my liking.  He looks like he''s a handful when he''s not pouting.  I see this on the fp.</td>', 'Heartbreaking and oddly charming, with just a bit too much contrast to my liking.  He looks like he''s a handful when he''s not pouting.  I see this on the fp.', '2010-09-22 13:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169411, 909930, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous processing and terrific dof.  What a devilish little face ;-)</td>', 'Marvelous processing and terrific dof.  What a devilish little face ;-)', '2010-09-22 13:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169413, 909959, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such a story here.  Fabulous motion blur and the grain really adds a feeling of recollection.  I feel that the crop is a bit too tight, especially on the left, making if feel a little suffocating, but I just love this.</td>', 'Such a story here.  Fabulous motion blur and the grain really adds a feeling of recollection.  I feel that the crop is a bit too tight, especially on the left, making if feel a little suffocating, but I just love this.', '2010-09-22 13:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169414, 910302, 96751, '<td valign="top">Not sure why she''s not looking at the camera...</td>', 'Not sure why she''s not looking at the camera...', '2010-09-22 13:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169418, 910714, 96751, '<td valign="top">You have really captured a wonderful attitude here - coquettish, playful yet removed, like she''s telling her best friend something embarrassing about you.  My only gripe is that the floor seems oddly blurred and distorted.</td>', 'You have really captured a wonderful attitude here - coquettish, playful yet removed, like she''s telling her best friend something embarrassing about you.  My only gripe is that the floor seems oddly blurred and distorted.', '2010-09-22 13:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169419, 910411, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the bold tones here, creating great shapes.  And the detail of he blinds on the wall.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Love the bold tones here, creating great shapes.  And the detail of he blinds on the wall.  Beautiful.', '2010-09-22 13:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169422, 910036, 96751, '<td valign="top">Terrific.  The only thing missing is a lipstick kiss somewhere, on the collar or the cheek.  Terrific lighting, but for some reason, the focus on the face is not nearly as sharp as on the chair and the hand with the glass.</td>', 'Terrific.  The only thing missing is a lipstick kiss somewhere, on the collar or the cheek.  Terrific lighting, but for some reason, the focus on the face is not nearly as sharp as on the chair and the hand with the glass.', '2010-09-22 13:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169425, 910442, 113419, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this is just too bright; should have been taken at a different time of day.  I also think that she is just slightly out of focus.  (And I would have probably had her wear high top western boots - but that''s just a personal choice.)</td>', 'In my opinion this is just too bright; should have been taken at a different time of day.  I also think that she is just slightly out of focus.  (And I would have probably had her wear high top western boots - but that''s just a personal choice.)', '2010-09-22 13:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169426, 910211, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  A classic portrait with exceptional detail throughout the image (although the back of the chair appears to be "floating").  Masterfully art-directed (WHERE did you get that chair??!!)  Her attitude is imperial and perfect for this image.  My only grip is that purse.  It completely draws my eye because there is just too much reflection on it (perhaps burning it a bit to take off the extreme brightness).  Also, (and this is a minor nit), the left handle of the purse seems to be strapped around the button on her chest.  Clearly this is an illusion, as the strap seems to be looped around her left arm, but what is that line that runs from the loop across her chest to the button?  Front page.</td>', 'Stunning.  A classic portrait with exceptional detail throughout the image (although the back of the chair appears to be "floating").  Masterfully art-directed (WHERE did you get that chair??!!)  Her attitude is imperial and perfect for this image.  My only grip is that purse.  It completely draws my eye because there is just too much reflection on it (perhaps burning it a bit to take off the extreme brightness).  Also, (and this is a minor nit), the left handle of the purse seems to be strapped around the button on her chest.  Clearly this is an illusion, as the strap seems to be looped around her left arm, but what is that line that runs from the loop across her chest to the button?  Front page.', '2010-09-22 13:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169427, 910759, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is art.  Gorgeous and dreamy.  Wish the chair portion was a bit more visible (it seems more implied that actual).</td>', 'This is art.  Gorgeous and dreamy.  Wish the chair portion was a bit more visible (it seems more implied that actual).', '2010-09-22 13:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169428, 910060, 113419, '<td valign="top">very well done portrait - however I can''t tell from the image that he is a railroad man - still nicely done  :-) 9</td>', 'very well done portrait - however I can''t tell from the image that he is a railroad man - still nicely done  :-) 9', '2010-09-22 13:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169430, 910618, 113419, '<td valign="top">wow!  she has a wonderful smile and a hint of mischief in her eyes!  I bet she can tell some stories!</td>', 'wow!  she has a wonderful smile and a hint of mischief in her eyes!  I bet she can tell some stories!', '2010-09-22 13:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169435, 910738, 96751, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking.  Surreal and wonderful.  It looks like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114969" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gyaban</a>?  Fabulous elements here.  The walking stick is a terrific touch, and I just love the contrast of the soft-edged shadow with the sharpness of the person.  My only grip is that it all seems way to crowded in the corner, especially the stick, which I think would have balanced the image better just a foot more to the left.  (And a teensy nit about the scuff marks on the baseboard on the left - easily fixed in advanced).  Front page.</td>', 'Breathtaking.  Surreal and wonderful.  It looks like  gyaban?  Fabulous elements here.  The walking stick is a terrific touch, and I just love the contrast of the soft-edged shadow with the sharpness of the person.  My only grip is that it all seems way to crowded in the corner, especially the stick, which I think would have balanced the image better just a foot more to the left.  (And a teensy nit about the scuff marks on the baseboard on the left - easily fixed in advanced).  Front page.', '2010-09-22 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169438, 910405, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is ribbon material.  Everything is exemplary and contributes to this image, the pov, the pp''ing, the colors, the pose. The lighting especially is terrific, bringing out the brightness on the reds and on the face and hands of this harbinger of happiness. I am so envious of people who have interesting skies (although for living in, I wouldn''t trade my blue ones)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=908851" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1266/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_908851.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1266/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_908851.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1266/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_908851.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is ribbon material.  Everything is exemplary and contributes to this image, the pov, the pp''ing, the colors, the pose. The lighting especially is terrific, bringing out the brightness on the reds and on the face and hands of this harbinger of happiness. I am so envious of people who have interesting skies (although for living in, I wouldn''t trade my blue ones) ', '2010-09-22 13:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169441, 910456, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  The dreamy processing adds to the whimsy of this image.</td>', 'Wonderful.  The dreamy processing adds to the whimsy of this image.', '2010-09-22 13:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169443, 910477, 96751, '<td valign="top">Strong emotion image.  The narrow color band also helps, adding to the feeling of distance and retreating from the world into his private place of pain or shame.</td>', 'Strong emotion image.  The narrow color band also helps, adding to the feeling of distance and retreating from the world into his private place of pain or shame.', '2010-09-22 13:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169444, 910706, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!!  Hilarious, and nicely shot, although I would have played with the colors on either her dress or the seat to separate them a bit (as they are practically the same color) and toned down the lighting on the seat (as they have almost the same amount of light).</td>', 'LOL!!!!  Hilarious, and nicely shot, although I would have played with the colors on either her dress or the seat to separate them a bit (as they are practically the same color) and toned down the lighting on the seat (as they have almost the same amount of light).', '2010-09-22 13:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169447, 910467, 96751, '<td valign="top">A wonderful picture in its own right, but I''m not seeing how it relates to this challenge.  If she''s in a seat, it''s not possible to tell.  Well not to me :-)</td>', 'A wonderful picture in its own right, but I''m not seeing how it relates to this challenge.  If she''s in a seat, it''s not possible to tell.  Well not to me :-)', '2010-09-22 13:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169449, 910770, 96751, '<td valign="top">Strong lines, interesting urban processing.  Undecided about the selective desat.</td>', 'Strong lines, interesting urban processing.  Undecided about the selective desat.', '2010-09-22 13:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169453, 910156, 86447, '<td valign="top">A portrait, in my opinion, shows the face of the person.  I like this... but not really well for the challenge.</td>', 'A portrait, in my opinion, shows the face of the person.  I like this... but not really well for the challenge.', '2010-09-22 13:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169454, 909867, 96751, '<td valign="top">What exactly is he warding off????  LOL!  Fun and quirky image - one of those instances where flash adds a superb element to the image.</td>', 'What exactly is he warding off????  LOL!  Fun and quirky image - one of those instances where flash adds a superb element to the image.', '2010-09-22 13:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169455, 910619, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love it!  I wish, though, that she didn''t appear to be floating in air.  The rest of the stuff ''floating'' is WONDERFUL... but she needs to be grounded or either clearly jumping.   Still a 7.</td>', 'I love it!  I wish, though, that she didn''t appear to be floating in air.  The rest of the stuff ''floating'' is WONDERFUL... but she needs to be grounded or either clearly jumping.   Still a 7.', '2010-09-22 13:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169456, 910374, 96751, '<td valign="top">Why, oh why did you choose such a busy and unattractive background for this image????!!!!  Fun idea, great sky/model/stool.  Horrible bg.</td>', 'Why, oh why did you choose such a busy and unattractive background for this image????!!!!  Fun idea, great sky/model/stool.  Horrible bg.', '2010-09-22 13:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169458, 909944, 86447, '<td valign="top">With a little more light on her face, this would really be a winner.</td>', 'With a little more light on her face, this would really be a winner.', '2010-09-22 13:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169460, 910392, 10485, '<td valign="top">Great muted color yet strong in shadows</td>', 'Great muted color yet strong in shadows', '2010-09-22 13:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169462, 910762, 86447, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and the processing and the ''look''.<br/> <br/>I wish his legs weren''t cut off at the ankle.   There''s an unwritten rule to not cut limbs off at joints.   Perhaps just a bit more would have been less ''uncomfortable'' for the view... and the model!  LOL!</td>', 'Love the angle and the processing and the ''look''. I wish his legs weren''t cut off at the ankle.   There''s an unwritten rule to not cut limbs off at joints.   Perhaps just a bit more would have been less ''uncomfortable'' for the view... and the model!  LOL!', '2010-09-22 13:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169465, 910758, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very urban cool!  The processing is so funky!!  It''s like he''s growing out of the ground from his feet - which are planted like roots and very strong and powerful.  They he starts to vanish as our eye moves upward until he seems to be melting into the background.  Or pehaps it''s the other way around - he is emerging from the background, and pouring himself through the stool down into the ground.  Fabulous, although the ends of the scarf dripping down between his legs looks like blood, and one just has to wonder what the heck happened there...</td>', 'Very urban cool!  The processing is so funky!!  It''s like he''s growing out of the ground from his feet - which are planted like roots and very strong and powerful.  They he starts to vanish as our eye moves upward until he seems to be melting into the background.  Or pehaps it''s the other way around - he is emerging from the background, and pouring himself through the stool down into the ground.  Fabulous, although the ends of the scarf dripping down between his legs looks like blood, and one just has to wonder what the heck happened there...', '2010-09-22 13:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169466, 910392, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great location!</td>', 'Great location!', '2010-09-22 13:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169467, 910716, 96751, '<td valign="top">She almost looks like a doll!  Gorgeous model.  Wonderful setting.  The lighting is perfect.</td>', 'She almost looks like a doll!  Gorgeous model.  Wonderful setting.  The lighting is perfect.', '2010-09-22 13:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169469, 910619, 96751, '<td valign="top">Strange image.  Everything seems to be floating about.</td>', 'Strange image.  Everything seems to be floating about.', '2010-09-22 13:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169471, 910718, 96751, '<td valign="top">OMG!  Fantastic image.  This is like a dream, my swirling thoughts anchored by a structural element that nevertheless is tenuous.  Like an apparition in the forest.  Brilliant and artistic.  This is so <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=15711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jutilda</a>!</td>', 'OMG!  Fantastic image.  This is like a dream, my swirling thoughts anchored by a structural element that nevertheless is tenuous.  Like an apparition in the forest.  Brilliant and artistic.  This is so  jutilda!', '2010-09-22 13:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169473, 910708, 96751, '<td valign="top">Intriguing image.  I wish the armchair wasn''t so squashed up against the curtain.  I think a little distance would have been better, not only compositionally, but also required him to lean over a bit in a more dynamic pose.</td>', 'Intriguing image.  I wish the armchair wasn''t so squashed up against the curtain.  I think a little distance would have been better, not only compositionally, but also required him to lean over a bit in a more dynamic pose.', '2010-09-22 13:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169482, 910355, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  I''m so envious - I''ve yet to see northern lights.</td>', 'Very cool!  I''m so envious - I''ve yet to see northern lights.', '2010-09-22 13:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169486, 910672, 96751, '<td valign="top">Images like this immediately make me want to make up a story, explore it, linger over the little bits of information that emerge from the fog.</td>', 'Images like this immediately make me want to make up a story, explore it, linger over the little bits of information that emerge from the fog.', '2010-09-22 14:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6169487, 910384, 96751, '<td valign="top">Portfolio material, both yours and hers!  I just wish the chair had been positioned more 3/4 - it would have given us a better view of the chair back, and would not have created that harsh shadow on her right arm.</td>', 'Portfolio material, both yours and hers!  I just wish the chair had been positioned more 3/4 - it would have given us a better view of the chair back, and would not have created that harsh shadow on her right arm.', '2010-09-22 14:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
