(6170092, 910442, 47470, '<td valign="top">The sky doesn''t add anything to this image, so I probably would have cropped tighter on the model, using a shallow depth of field to turn the background into beautiful tones of gold.  I do like her relaxed, turned-away-from-the-camera expression.</td>', 'The sky doesn''t add anything to this image, so I probably would have cropped tighter on the model, using a shallow depth of field to turn the background into beautiful tones of gold.  I do like her relaxed, turned-away-from-the-camera expression.', '2010-09-23 03:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
