(6170410, 910211, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, I love this.  A really strong mono work, but oh, what a strong portrait.  Your mother looks like such a strong woman, really in control of her life and of her family, stylish and smart.  But there is also a sense of vulnerability, or a reticence - perhaps it is the handbag, that so effectively places a barrier between herself and the viewer.  A truly fascinating portrait that demands my attention.  My only criticism is that the light has reflected a little too much from the handbag, but nonetheless a very solid 10 from me, and a photo of real quality.</td>', 'Oh wow, I love this.  A really strong mono work, but oh, what a strong portrait.  Your mother looks like such a strong woman, really in control of her life and of her family, stylish and smart.  But there is also a sense of vulnerability, or a reticence - perhaps it is the handbag, that so effectively places a barrier between herself and the viewer.  A truly fascinating portrait that demands my attention.  My only criticism is that the light has reflected a little too much from the handbag, but nonetheless a very solid 10 from me, and a photo of real quality.', '2010-09-23 14:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170416, 910618, 67258, '<td valign="top">Flirty Gerty looks like a truly wonderful and remarkable character, and I do hope we meet her in future challenges.  This is a super, and thoroughly sympathetic portrait.  For this challenge, though, I do wish that the chair was more prominent, nonetheless, in my top 5 of the challenge.</td>', 'Flirty Gerty looks like a truly wonderful and remarkable character, and I do hope we meet her in future challenges.  This is a super, and thoroughly sympathetic portrait.  For this challenge, though, I do wish that the chair was more prominent, nonetheless, in my top 5 of the challenge.', '2010-09-23 14:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170422, 910772, 67258, '<td valign="top">Slippy? What will you also do?  Th headless look is a bit strange, but certainly a photo that has made me laugh.</td>', 'Slippy? What will you also do?  Th headless look is a bit strange, but certainly a photo that has made me laugh.', '2010-09-23 14:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170512, 910211, 24642, '<td valign="top">By far the best photo in the challenge.  A very interesting chair in shape and texture.  The pose works well and the lighting is brilliant.  I really like the choise of dark clothes and background with the light colored chair.  Congrats you and your mother can be proud of this collaboration.</td>', 'By far the best photo in the challenge.  A very interesting chair in shape and texture.  The pose works well and the lighting is brilliant.  I really like the choise of dark clothes and background with the light colored chair.  Congrats you and your mother can be proud of this collaboration.', '2010-09-23 16:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170513, 910405, 24642, '<td valign="top">Clever</td>', 'Clever', '2010-09-23 16:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170516, 910738, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the surreal feel of this shot.</td>', 'I like the surreal feel of this shot.', '2010-09-23 16:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170638, 910664, 12076, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Funny. And one of the images that really invites me to linger.</td>', 'Love it.  Funny. And one of the images that really invites me to linger.', '2010-09-23 19:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170640, 910672, 12076, '<td valign="top">WTF??     No, wait...  I love a WTF photo.  And when I think about the essence of a person...  its vague, changing, a compilation of experiences and environment, scary, and a little foggy too.  So this one is right on.  What''s cool here is it is more than just a superb photo of you mother or someone.  There are those in this challenge too.  (And they are so hard to do well.)  So, do really learn something about the girl here?  Haha.. of course not.  But it is a very good visual definition of the essence of man, I think.  By the way, when viewed up close, there is more essence visible.  From farther away I just see the girl and the chair.</td>', 'WTF??     No, wait...  I love a WTF photo.  And when I think about the essence of a person...  its vague, changing, a compilation of experiences and environment, scary, and a little foggy too.  So this one is right on.  What''s cool here is it is more than just a superb photo of you mother or someone.  There are those in this challenge too.  (And they are so hard to do well.)  So, do really learn something about the girl here?  Haha.. of course not.  But it is a very good visual definition of the essence of man, I think.  By the way, when viewed up close, there is more essence visible.  From farther away I just see the girl and the chair.', '2010-09-23 19:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170641, 910211, 94241, '<td valign="top">I think it needs a touch more light on the lower right, to anchor it.  It feels like it''s all just floating in space.</td>', 'I think it needs a touch more light on the lower right, to anchor it.  It feels like it''s all just floating in space.', '2010-09-23 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170650, 910211, 12076, '<td valign="top">My highest scoring photo.  I think these are so hard to do.  I can''t do a good portrait.  If there is anything I don''t like about it is the glare off of her purse.</td>', 'My highest scoring photo.  I think these are so hard to do.  I can''t do a good portrait.  If there is anything I don''t like about it is the glare off of her purse.', '2010-09-23 19:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170651, 910739, 12076, '<td valign="top">When I think of a portrait, I tend to think of a formal, posed image.  But for this challenge, there is the chair, and the person, and his eyes and outfit just ooze something about him.  Too bad about the heads on the bottom, in my opinion, but this is still one of my favorites and highest scores in the challenge.  Nice.</td>', 'When I think of a portrait, I tend to think of a formal, posed image.  But for this challenge, there is the chair, and the person, and his eyes and outfit just ooze something about him.  Too bad about the heads on the bottom, in my opinion, but this is still one of my favorites and highest scores in the challenge.  Nice.', '2010-09-23 19:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6170674, 910706, 554, '<td valign="top">If they have a "Repulse The Voter" challenge you might be able to re-use that sign. Care to guess my vote?</td>', 'If they have a "Repulse The Voter" challenge you might be able to re-use that sign. Care to guess my vote?', '2010-09-23 20:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
