(6171237, 910738, 103032, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  Has lots of "mystery" to it.  I like the possibility that the photo of the face is the person in the chair.  Very interesting composition, I do like the lighting that creates the shadow which (to me) is as much of the composition as the person in the chair.  Love the lighting and the effects of it.<br/>The only thing I don''t understand is the walking stick; is it part of the person? or an element to "balance" the composition?  Whatever the case, I really like this pic.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  Has lots of "mystery" to it.  I like the possibility that the photo of the face is the person in the chair.  Very interesting composition, I do like the lighting that creates the shadow which (to me) is as much of the composition as the person in the chair.  Love the lighting and the effects of it.The only thing I don''t understand is the walking stick; is it part of the person? or an element to "balance" the composition?  Whatever the case, I really like this pic.', '2010-09-24 18:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171242, 910762, 103032, '<td valign="top">The low POV gives this portrait some interest.</td>', 'The low POV gives this portrait some interest.', '2010-09-24 18:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171243, 910676, 103032, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting.  Like how the outside light cast the shadow on the floor.  Sensual and gritty at the same time.  Interesting image.</td>', 'Like the lighting.  Like how the outside light cast the shadow on the floor.  Sensual and gritty at the same time.  Interesting image.', '2010-09-24 18:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6171293, 910615, 117955, '<td valign="top">Good title. Image could be less "busy", just my opinion. I''m not really sure what a "DSi" is, but can use my imagination:)</td>', 'Good title. Image could be less "busy", just my opinion. I''m not really sure what a "DSi" is, but can use my imagination:)', '2010-09-24 21:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
