(6171299, 910750, 117955, '<td valign="top">This is so cool -- would love to know how you did this; did he jump off the roof or the ground? I can''t decide if the bricks are distracting or interesting, but I like it:)</td>', 'This is so cool -- would love to know how you did this; did he jump off the roof or the ground? I can''t decide if the bricks are distracting or interesting, but I like it:)', '2010-09-24 21:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
