(6171320, 909944, 117955, '<td valign="top">Where ever did you find this chair??? OMG, its fabulous! I like all the shiny-ness, but would like for there to be a little more light on the lady. I do really like this one, though.</td>', 'Where ever did you find this chair??? OMG, its fabulous! I like all the shiny-ness, but would like for there to be a little more light on the lady. I do really like this one, though.', '2010-09-24 21:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
