(6171325, 910739, 117955, '<td valign="top">I''d give anything to be this skinny... just kidding. I really like this shot, and that the color in his costume is a little bolder than in the rest of the photo. Very nice.</td>', 'I''d give anything to be this skinny... just kidding. I really like this shot, and that the color in his costume is a little bolder than in the rest of the photo. Very nice.', '2010-09-24 21:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
