(6174232, 910718, 30364, '<td valign="top">Was top three for me with a 7, which may sound niggardly but it''s double my average score.  Of course, that''s rather a poisoned chalice: my top two finished in the last five.  And my own finished in the last one. So maybe I had over-rated yours after all, Tom?</td>', 'Was top three for me with a 7, which may sound niggardly but it''s double my average score.  Of course, that''s rather a poisoned chalice: my top two finished in the last five.  And my own finished in the last one. So maybe I had over-rated yours after all, Tom?', '2010-09-29 02:02:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6174233, 910211, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 3rd place. It''s an excellent portrait, and your mother''s energy and character shine out from her gaze.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 3rd place. It''s an excellent portrait, and your mother''s energy and character shine out from her gaze.', '2010-09-29 02:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6174239, 909959, 62357, '<td valign="top">Didn''t have time to vote this week and am only now scrolling through.  How this ended up in last spot will be something I ponder all day.  How irritating for you.  Had I voted, you may have got a 4!  Damn</td>', 'Didn''t have time to vote this week and am only now scrolling through.  How this ended up in last spot will be something I ponder all day.  How irritating for you.  Had I voted, you may have got a 4!  Damn', '2010-09-29 02:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6174241, 910672, 62357, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  I''m enjoying looking at the entries at this end much better than the other colourful end :)</td>', 'Wonderful.  I''m enjoying looking at the entries at this end much better than the other colourful end :)', '2010-09-29 02:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6174246, 910672, 69668, '<td valign="top">I found this image very compelling.  I like it very much!!</td>', 'I found this image very compelling.  I like it very much!!', '2010-09-29 02:29:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6174248, 909959, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by salmiakki:</b></div><hr/><i> ... How this ended up in last spot will be something I ponder all day.  How irritating for you ... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s not at all irritating for me.  It''s comforting.  The many ''flaws'' were intentional.  The marginalised composition seemed appropriate.  The offhand blur was sadly apt.  The disassociation of this person and this chair was a documentary imperative.  The titular reference to Talking Heads was merely a pun; a test that nobody took.  So I''m satisfied with it.  I''d have scored it a five myself, but I''m a very poor judge.</td>', 'Originally posted by salmiakki: ... How this ended up in last spot will be something I ponder all day.  How irritating for you ...   It''s not at all irritating for me.  It''s comforting.  The many ''flaws'' were intentional.  The marginalised composition seemed appropriate.  The offhand blur was sadly apt.  The disassociation of this person and this chair was a documentary imperative.  The titular reference to Talking Heads was merely a pun; a test that nobody took.  So I''m satisfied with it.  I''d have scored it a five myself, but I''m a very poor judge.', '2010-09-29 02:35:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6174252, 909959, 16241, '<td valign="top">i beat you, i got 31 ones.</td>', 'i beat you, i got 31 ones.', '2010-09-29 02:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6174255, 910402, 66515, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first 7! My condolences that it didn''t have a ribbon to go with it. (Where is that 7+ no ribbon image again?)</td>', 'Congrats on your first 7! My condolences that it didn''t have a ribbon to go with it. (Where is that 7+ no ribbon image again?)', '2010-09-29 02:56:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6174259, 910405, 96751, '<td valign="top">Boy, can you EVER!!!!  Welcome back, and with a bang!</td>', 'Boy, can you EVER!!!!  Welcome back, and with a bang!', '2010-09-29 02:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6174264, 909974, 96751, '<td valign="top">Congrats Timfy!  And stop taking pictures of your kids already!  You''re hogging the fp!</td>', 'Congrats Timfy!  And stop taking pictures of your kids already!  You''re hogging the fp!', '2010-09-29 03:04:21.000000', NULL, 0),
