(6174270, 910405, 55822, '<td valign="top">Congrats Judi, a more deserving blue I can''t imagine. And not just for the photo.</td>', 'Congrats Judi, a more deserving blue I can''t imagine. And not just for the photo.', '2010-09-29 03:12:46.000000', NULL, 0),
