(6174272, 909959, 20799, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to vote in this challenge but I looked at the pictures during voting and this was my absolute favorite. It was its imagination and the approach to the idea of a portrait with chair that got to me... and the title. Absolutely amazing!</td>', 'I didn''t get to vote in this challenge but I looked at the pictures during voting and this was my absolute favorite. It was its imagination and the approach to the idea of a portrait with chair that got to me... and the title. Absolutely amazing!', '2010-09-29 03:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
