(6174284, 910402, 99710, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on your HM!  Beautiful image.  Love that I think it has too much contrast and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=47470" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">geinafets</a> thinks it needs more! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I know, when I read both of your comments, I was confused about which one to agree with! hehehe....</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Congrats on your HM!  Beautiful image.  Love that I think it has too much contrast and  geinafets thinks it needs more!   I know, when I read both of your comments, I was confused about which one to agree with! hehehe....', '2010-09-29 03:30:13.000000', NULL, 0),
