(6174432, 910405, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by VitaminB:</b></div><hr/><i> I am glad to see that all things are as they should be. Congrats on the blue Judi, and for the your all time personal top 3. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>OMG..I didn''t even realise that.  Yayyyyyyyy....thankyou for telling me.</td>', 'Originally posted by VitaminB: I am glad to see that all things are as they should be. Congrats on the blue Judi, and for the your all time personal top 3.   OMG..I didn''t even realise that.  Yayyyyyyyy....thankyou for telling me.', '2010-09-29 07:23:38.000000', NULL, 0),
