(6174749, 910211, 110090, '<td valign="top">----------------------------*******-----------------------------------------<br/> <br/>Im so happy that THIS picture got me a ribbon.  Thank you for all your comments and kind words!!<br/> <br/>Ohh my ..!!!!  You were right about my mother in your comments.  She is a strong woman with a lot of grace, BUT she has a great sense of humor.  (Not showing in the picture on my request). She has had a hilarious time this morning reading all your comments.  <br/> <br/>Thanks again,<br/>SVAVA<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-29 12:25:50.</i></td>', '----------------------------*******----------------------------------------- Im so happy that THIS picture got me a ribbon.  Thank you for all your comments and kind words!! Ohh my ..!!!!  You were right about my mother in your comments.  She is a strong woman with a lot of grace, BUT she has a great sense of humor.  (Not showing in the picture on my request). She has had a hilarious time this morning reading all your comments.   Thanks again,SVAVA', '2010-09-29 11:53:30.000000', '2010-09-29 13:25:50.000000', 0),
