(6178680, 910405, 43463, '<td valign="top">Holy moly! Way to go on getting back in the swing of things Judi! Congrats on your Blue...and this when you are still recovering! <br/> <br/>Great image and also great mood and feel of "happy/carefree/live life to the fullest" This gentleman will not be ''grounded'' in his seat. Stay seated does not enter into the picture as he let''s his playful side free. Imagination and joy will carry him out of his seat - lifting his spirits even though the sky may be grey/stormy/cloudy. Great processing too - the red of the balloon really stands out from the stormy/dark sky. Pose of the model is great as that he is ready to be ''swept'' away.</td>', 'Holy moly! Way to go on getting back in the swing of things Judi! Congrats on your Blue...and this when you are still recovering!  Great image and also great mood and feel of "happy/carefree/live life to the fullest" This gentleman will not be ''grounded'' in his seat. Stay seated does not enter into the picture as he let''s his playful side free. Imagination and joy will carry him out of his seat - lifting his spirits even though the sky may be grey/stormy/cloudy. Great processing too - the red of the balloon really stands out from the stormy/dark sky. Pose of the model is great as that he is ready to be ''swept'' away.', '2010-10-02 23:34:49.000000', NULL, 0),
